{"seq":3,"slug":"biped-quadruped-control","title":"双足与四足控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/legged/biped-quadruped-control","wordCount":1773,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"双足与四足控制\">双足与四足控制</h1><p>双足和四足看似只是腿数不同，控制哲学却分道扬镳：四足天然拥有更大的支撑多边形、更多冗余落足点，容错高；双足支撑面窄、重心高，几乎每一步都在主动救一次倾覆。本篇讲的是把平衡判据落成具体控制架构的工程做法——四足如何用对角小跑稳健巡检，双足如何用预观控制走出连续步态。这里聚焦&quot;经典/模型驱动&quot;的控制结构；统一的优化框架见 <a href=\"../control/whole-body-mpc\">全身控制与 MPC</a>，端到端学习见 <a href=\"../control/learning-locomotion\">学习驱动运动控制</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>无论几条腿，腿足控制都呈现分层结构：上层规划&quot;想怎么动&quot;（步态、落足点、机身轨迹），下层把它翻译成关节力矩并实时纠偏。腿数主要影响中间层——支撑多边形大小、可用冗余、以及对单步失误的容忍度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[高层: 速度/方向指令] --&gt; B[步态与落足规划]&#10;  B --&gt; C[机身轨迹生成&lt;br/&gt;ZMP / 捕获点约束]&#10;  C --&gt; D[腿数分支]&#10;  D --&gt; E[四足: 大支撑多边形&lt;br/&gt;对角小跑 容错高]&#10;  D --&gt; F[双足: 窄支撑 高重心&lt;br/&gt;预观控制 每步救场]&#10;  E --&gt; G[关节力矩 / 阻抗指令]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[本体感知反馈 闭环]\">flowchart TD\n  A[高层: 速度/方向指令] --&gt; B[步态与落足规划]\n  B --&gt; C[机身轨迹生成&lt;br/&gt;ZMP / 捕获点约束]\n  C --&gt; D[腿数分支]\n  D --&gt; E[四足: 大支撑多边形&lt;br/&gt;对角小跑 容错高]\n  D --&gt; F[双足: 窄支撑 高重心&lt;br/&gt;预观控制 每步救场]\n  E --&gt; G[关节力矩 / 阻抗指令]\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[本体感知反馈 闭环]</pre><p>下表对比双足与四足在控制上的关键差异。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>四足</th>\n<th>双足</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>支撑多边形</td>\n<td>大（多点）</td>\n<td>小（单/双脚）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静态稳定可行性</td>\n<td>高（爬行步态）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主导动态步态</td>\n<td>对角小跑 trot</td>\n<td>行走/奔跑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容错性</td>\n<td>高（一腿失误可补）</td>\n<td>低（每步关键）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型难点</td>\n<td>高速越障、姿态保持</td>\n<td>防倾覆、上肢协调</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"四足控制-从虚拟模型到反作用力优化\">四足控制：从虚拟模型到反作用力优化</h2><p>四足的工程主力路线之一是<strong>虚拟模型控制（VMC）</strong>：把机身想象成被若干虚拟弹簧-阻尼器连到期望位姿，算出需要的虚拟力与力矩，再分配到各支撑腿的足端力。它直观、计算轻，能让机身像被&quot;软绳吊住&quot;般保持高度与水平。</p>\n<p>更现代的路线是<strong>接触力优化</strong>：四足的核心控制量其实是各支撑足的地面反作用力（GRF）。给定期望的机身加速度（线与角），机身的牛顿-欧拉方程把它约束为各足端力之和与力矩之和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">p</mi><mo>¨</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">p</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">L</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i \\boldsymbol{f}_i = m(\\ddot{\\boldsymbol{p}}_c - \\boldsymbol{g}), \\qquad \\sum_i (\\boldsymbol{p}_i - \\boldsymbol{p}_c)\\times\\boldsymbol{f}_i = \\dot{\\boldsymbol{L}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.1104em;\">f</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6813em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">p</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.037em;\">g</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">p</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">p</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.1104em;\">f</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.923em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.923em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">L</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2551em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1389em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>由于支撑腿多于需要约束的自由度，足端力有冗余，可用二次规划（QP）在摩擦锥约束下求一组最优分配，再由准直驱关节执行。MIT Cheetah 系列正是这条&quot;足端力 QP + 高带宽关节&quot;路线的代表，使四足能稳健 trot、转向乃至后空翻。这套足端力思路也是 <a href=\"../control/whole-body-mpc\">全身控制与 MPC</a> 的内核，只是 MPC 把它从单步扩展到预测时域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"双足控制-预观控制与每步救场\">双足控制：预观控制与每步救场</h2><p>双足的窄支撑面让它没有四足那种容错余地。经典工程方案是基于 ZMP 的<strong>预观控制（preview control）</strong>：因为当前该如何移动重心，取决于未来若干步的落足计划，控制器需要&quot;预看&quot;未来参考 ZMP 轨迹，提前规划重心运动，使实际 ZMP 始终落在脚底。这把双足行走变成一个带前瞻的跟踪问题，是 ASIMO、HRP 系列稳定行走的基础。</p>\n<p>但平地预观只能产生略显僵硬的步态。受扰恢复要靠 <a href=\"balance-dynamic-stability\">平衡与动态稳定</a> 的捕获点：被推时实时计算新捕获点并跨步过去，这就是双足&quot;每步都在救场&quot;的本质。三类恢复策略按扰动大小递进——踝策略（小扰动靠踝力矩调 ZMP）、髋策略（中扰动靠上身反向甩动产生角动量）、跨步策略（大扰动靠迈步重置支撑多边形）。人形机器人还要协调手臂摆动来抵消行走中的躯干偏航角动量，这把控制问题从腿扩展到全身。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分层架构与本体感知闭环\">分层架构与本体感知闭环</h2><p>把上述拆解拼起来，双足与四足共享同一套<strong>分层闭环</strong>：最上层接收速度/方向指令，中层做步态与落足规划并施加平衡约束，底层以高频（常达 1 kHz）把期望足端力或关节阻抗转成电流，靠本体感知（关节编码器、IMU、足底接触/力传感）实时反馈纠偏。机身位姿来自 <a href=\"../foundations/localization-odometry\">定位与里程计</a> 的状态估计——若估计抖动，整条链都会失稳。</p>\n<p>腿数的差异最终体现在这套架构的参数与裕度上：四足靠冗余把单步误差摊薄，可在崎岖地形精细落足；双足靠前瞻与高频反馈把每一步的风险压住，对延迟和估计误差极其敏感。理解这套经典架构，才能看清后续 <a href=\"../control/whole-body-mpc\">全身控制与 MPC</a> 如何用统一优化取代手工分配，以及 <a href=\"../control/learning-locomotion\">学习驱动运动控制</a> 如何用策略网络直接替代中底两层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"足端力-qp-从期望加速度到关节指令\">足端力 QP：从期望加速度到关节指令</h2><p>四足的接触力优化可以写成一台可实时求解的二次规划，其结构值得展开看清。给定机身期望加速度，QP 的决策变量是各支撑足端力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{f}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.1104em;\">f</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">f</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>des</mtext></msubsup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">p</mi><mo>¨</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">p</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">L</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mtext>des</mtext></msup></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mtext>摩擦锥</mtext></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min_{\\{\\boldsymbol{f}_i\\}} \\sum_i w\\| \\boldsymbol{f}_i - \\boldsymbol{f}_i^{\\text{des}}\\|^2 \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad \\begin{cases} \\sum_i \\boldsymbol{f}_i = m(\\ddot{\\boldsymbol{p}}_c - \\boldsymbol{g}) \\\\ \\sum_i (\\boldsymbol{p}_i - \\boldsymbol{p}_c)\\times\\boldsymbol{f}_i = \\dot{\\boldsymbol{L}}^{\\text{des}} \\\\ \\boldsymbol{f}_i \\in \\text{摩擦锥} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist