\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.1104em;\">f</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">摩擦锥</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.987em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>目标里保留一个期望足端力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">f</mi><mi>i</mi><mtext>des</mtext></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{f}_i^{\\text{des}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1804em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.1104em;\">f</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9334em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">des</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 作为正则项，是工程上极关键的技巧：仅靠两个等式约束，足端力有无限多组解，解出的往往是一组反直觉、左右大幅内耗的力；加入正则项把解拉向&quot;对称、省力矩&quot;的一支，关节既不打架也不浪费。</p>\n<p>解出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{f}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.1104em;\">f</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 后，再经腿的雅可比反算关节力矩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">τ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>J</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msubsup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\tau}_i = J_i^\\top \\boldsymbol{f}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5944em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.1347em;\">τ</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1078em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.0962em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.1104em;\">f</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 下发给准直驱关节。下表把这条链路的两端说清楚。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>频率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>机身目标</td>\n<td>速度/姿态指令</td>\n<td>期望加速度、动量</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>足端力 QP</td>\n<td>期望加速度+接触约束</td>\n<td>各足端力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{f}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.1104em;\">f</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关节映射</td>\n<td>足端力 + 雅可比</td>\n<td>关节力矩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\tau}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.1347em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>kHz</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关节级力控</td>\n<td>力矩指令</td>\n<td>电流</td>\n<td>kHz</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>可见四足控制的本质是&quot;在接触力空间做一次带约束的分配&quot;——这也正是 <a href=\"../control/whole-body-mpc\">全身控制与 MPC</a> 把同一思想扩展到关节空间与预测时域后的落脚点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>腿足控制普遍分层：上层规划、中层落足与平衡约束、底层高频力矩纠偏。</li>\n<li>腿数主要影响中间层：四足支撑面大、容错高，双足窄支撑、每步在救倾覆。</li>\n<li>四足主力路线是虚拟模型控制与足端反作用力 QP 优化，后者是 MPC 的内核。</li>\n<li>双足用基于 ZMP 的预观控制做前瞻跟踪，受扰恢复按踝-髋-跨步三策略递进。</li>\n<li>双足需协调手臂摆动抵消躯干角动量，把控制从腿扩展到全身。</li>\n<li>分层闭环依赖本体感知与位姿估计，估计抖动会沿链放大导致失稳。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"双足与四足控制","id":"双足与四足控制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"四足控制：从虚拟模型到反作用力优化","id":"四足控制-从虚拟模型到反作用力优化"},{"level":2,"text":"双足控制：预观控制与每步救场","id":"双足控制-预观控制与每步救场"},{"level":2,"text":"分层架构与本体感知闭环","id":"分层架构与本体感知闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"足端力 QP：从期望加速度到关节指令","id":"足端力-qp-从期望加速度到关节指令"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"平衡与动态稳定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/legged/balance-dynamic-stability"},"next":{"title":"全身控制与 MPC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/control/whole-body-mpc"}}